{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/eleve-deyaar-development-jebel-ali","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":657,"crm_id":"1098","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Eleve","slug":"eleve-deyaar-development-jebel-ali","display_address":"Jebel Ali","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Deyaar Development","price":555458,"display_price":"555K","lattitude":24.9794188,"longitude":55.0904851,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>ÉLEVÉ Dubai is a residential tower in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-jebel-ali/\">Downtown Jebel Ali</a>, positioned along Sheikh Zayed Road near the Jebel Ali Port. Developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-deyaar-development/\">Deyaar Development</a>, a developer with over two decades and 20 million sq. ft. of delivered projects across Dubai, ÉLEVÉ offers <strong>studio, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments</strong> and a few garden apartments, ranging from 409 to 2,938 sq. ft.</p><p>Residents have access to a fully equipped gym with a yoga terrace, a swimming pool with a dedicated kids' pool, a residents' lounge, a club room with sports and billiards facilities, and landscaped outdoor seating areas. Built with eco-friendly materials and technologies, ÉLEVÉ pairs everyday comfort with quick access to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-marina/\">Dubai Marina</a>, JLT and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Downtown Dubai.</a></p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_d1bcd3b140.jpg","hash":"Banne