io, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside garden apartments.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10569,"answer":"<p>ÉLEVÉ is located in Downtown Jebel Ali, Zone 1, along Sheikh Zayed Road, near the UAE Exchange Metro Station.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Eleve by Deyaar located?"},{"id":10570,"answer":"<p>Prices start from AED 555,458 for a studio, rising to AED 882,648 for a 1-bedroom, AED 1,356,568 for a 2-bedroom, and AED 2,220,020 for a 3-bedroom.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the starting price of Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10571,"answer":"<p>Downtown Jebel Ali's connectivity to Dubai Marina, JLT, Downtown Dubai and Abu Dhabi via Sheikh Zayed Road, combined with a long-term payment plan and an established developer, makes ÉLEVÉ a strong option for buyers and investors alike.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Eleve by Deyaar a good investment?"},{"id":10572,"answer":"<p>Buyers pay 10% on booking, followed by six instalments of 8% through December 2026, 12% on handover in May 2027, then the remaining 30% spread over 30 months post-handover at 1% per month.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What payment plan does Eleve by Deyaar offer?"},{"id":10573,"answer":"<p>ÉLEVÉ offers studios, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, and garden apartments, ranging from 409 to 2,938 sq. ft.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What apartment types are available at Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10574,"answer":"<p>Handover is scheduled for 2027.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the handover for Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10575,"answer":"<p>ÉLEVÉ is developed by Deyaar Development.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Eleve?"},{"id":10576,"answer":"<p>Residents have access to a swimming pool with a kids' pool, a gym with a yoga terrace, a residents' lounge, a club room with sport and billiards facilities, and landscaped outdoor seating areas.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10577,"answer":"<p>Downtown Jebel Ali offers quick access to major business hubs, including JAFZA and Jebel Ali Industrial Area, along with growing infrastructure and proximity to key Dubai landmarks via Sheikh Zayed Road.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Why invest in Downtown Jebel Ali?"},{"id":10578,"answer":"<p>Yes. Since Downtown Jebel Ali is a designated freehold area, foreign nationals can purchase and fully own apartments at ÉLEVÉ.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Can foreigners buy property at Eleve by Deyaar?"},{"id":10579,"answer":"<p>Yes. ÉLEVÉ is located in Downtown Jebel Ali, one of Dubai's officially designated freehold zones, giving buyers full ownership rights.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Eleve by Deyaar freehold?"},{"id":10580,"answer":"<p>Its Downtown Jebel Ali address near Jebel Ali Port, combined with a distinctive tower design, resort-style amenities, and a developer with two decades of delivery history, sets ÉLEVÉ apart.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Eleve by Deyaar different from other projects?"},{"id":10581,"answer":"<p>Nearby landmarks include Palm Jebel Ali &amp; The Waterfront, Dubai Marina, JLT, The Dubai Mall, and Al Maktoum International Airport.</p>","question":"What are the nearby landmarks to Eleve by Deyaar?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.webp","format":"webp","transform":"340x","created_at":"2025-08-26 15:11:19.440","updated_at":"2025-08-27 02:18:19.016"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1504x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1504x","created_at":"2025-08-26 15:11:19.440","updated_at":"2025-08-27 02:18:19.016"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1504x/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","format":"png","tran